ty to mitigate the risk of exploitation. Maintaining rigorous patch management and continuous monitoring of network gateways remains the most effective defense against this persistent adversary. Our team will continue to track these developments and provide updated guidance as more intelligence becomes available regarding the actor’s TTPs and shifting target profile.

