fy the authenticity of all external communication endpoints. We are currently reviewing our internal DNS logs and outbound traffic patterns to identify any anomalies that align with the tactics used by these registrants. Continued focus on proactive infrastructure monitoring is essential to mitigate the risk of interception and maintain the overall security posture of our enterprise network perimeter against these opportunistic adversaries.

