izational resilience. By implementing these fundamental security controls, entities can significantly reduce their attack surface and mitigate the impact of potential incursions. Vigilance remains our most effective tool in countering the persistent and evolving threat posed by these actors, and organizations must ensure that their security infrastructure is capable of detecting and disrupting these malicious campaigns before they can achieve their objectives of disruption and sabotage.

